R1 = Sum(abs(U(obs)-U(calc)))/Sum(abs(U(obs)))     =   0.05652

R2 = Sqrt(Sum((U(obs)-U(calc))**2)/Sum(U(obs)**2)) =   0.05200

S  = Sqrt(Sum((U(obs)-U(calc))**2)/(6*N-NS*M))     =   0.00128

N  = Number of Atoms in Rigid Group                =        11

NS = Symmetry Factor                               =         1

M  = Number of Rigid-Body Parameters               =        20

     Largest abs(U(obs)-U(calc))                   =   0.00236

